In this contribution, the following proposal were made: Proposal 1: All the general requirements shall be introduced by RAN5 basket WIs. Regarding the power class dependent requirements, i.e. MOP, MPR, A-MPR, SEM, ACLR, A-SEM, A-SE and REFSENS, the PC3 requirements shall be introduced by RAN5 basket WIs, and the HP requirements shall be introduced by RAN5 HP WIs. Proposal 2: HP requirements can’t be introduced earlier than generic and PC3 requirements are completed. Proposal 3: If Company A wants to contribute to PC3 configuration Company A needs to contact the Basket rapporteur to update the WP. Company A submit CR under basket WI. Basket rapporteur needs to check the CR doesn’t contain HP related contents. Proposal 4: If Company A wants to contribute to HP configuration, and the corresponding PC3 configuration is still pending, A needs to take both HP and PC3 configurations. Company A contacts Basket rapporteur and HP rapporteur to update the WP. Company A submit CR of generic and PC3 specific contents under basket WI. Company A submit CR of HP specific contents under HP WI. Basket rapporteur and HP rapporteur to check whether the CRs include improper contents. Proposal 5: If Company A wants to contribute to HP configuration, and the corresponding PC3 configuration is taken by Company B. Company A contacts HP rapporteur to update the WP. Company A contacts Company B to coordinate the plan to ensure generic and PC3 specific contents could be introduced earlier than HP or at the same meeting. Company A submit CR of HP specific contents under HP WI. Basket rapporteur and HP rapporteur to check whether the CRs include improper contents.

